<title>USA: El Salvador cancels PL-480 vegoil tender - agent.</title>
<headline>El Salvador cancels PL-480 vegoil tender - agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador has cancelled its tender for 4,000 to 5,000 tonnes prime bleachable summer yellow (PBSY) cottonseed oil in bulk and 750 to 1,250 tonnes sunflowerseed oil under the PL-480, Title I export program, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>No reason was given.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
